  {
   "topic": "Input levels",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "The 74AHC1G125 has CMOS switching thresholds and works from 2 V to 5.5 V. The 74AHCT1G125 has TTL thresholds (VIH 2.0 V, VIL 0.8 V) and works from 4.5 V to 5.5 V."
  },
  {
   "topic": "Switching-time measurement",
   "page": 11,
   "text": "Delays are timed between the VM crossings of input and output: VM is 0.5×VCC on the 74AHC1G125 input and 1.5 V on the 74AHCT1G125 input, 0.5×VCC on the output. A disable time ends when the output has moved 0.3 V from VOL or VOH. Input edges are 3 ns or faster, the load is 15 pF or 50 pF with 1 kΩ."
  }
